cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use FlagQuantum in work you publish, please cite the software using
  the metadata in this file.
title: FlagQuantum
abstract: >-
  A PyTorch-first framework for differentiable quantum computing and quantum
  AI. FlagQuantum builds circuits through one versioned intermediate
  representation and executes them across statevector, matrix product state,
  tensor-network, density-matrix, and stabilizer representations, across CPU,
  single-accelerator, multi-accelerator, and multi-node execution, and across
  multiple accelerator vendors, without rewriting the program. Backend
  selection may change execution, but it does not change the meaning of the
  program or the result contract.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
